## What's new in v1.1.2

- Fixed Android session persistence so closing and reopening Gullak should return to the six-digit PIN screen instead of unexpectedly signing the account out.
- Updated the PIN and update screens to use Gullak's piggy-bank artwork, matching the intro animation.
- Kept the Android-only PIN and update experience separate from the public web version.

The Android APK is signed with the existing release key, so it can update an existing installation.